{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124235","id":4763669368,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-_TeA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124235","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124235.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124235.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124235","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124235/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124235/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124235/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7b73663e1ba62e93b7a291843fb1836c6642c126","number":124235,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"editor: Fix system clipboard sync when copying integer properties","user":{"login":"Flaybe","id":8083756,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwODM3NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8083756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe","html_url":"https://github.com/Flaybe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n--> \r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #124230\r\n\r\nFixes an issue where using the \"Copy Value\" context menu action on integer properties in the Inspector (collision layers and masks) only updated Godot's internal variant clipboard. Because it bypassed the OS system clipboard, pasting the copied value into an external application would paste stale text instead of the integer.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHow it works:\r\nThe fix modifies `EditorProperty::menu_option` to ensure that when `MENU_COPY_VALUE` is triggered and the property value is an integer `(Variant::INT)`, the value is explicitly pushed to the system clipboard using `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->clipboard_set()`.\r\n\r\nfrom the issue the expected behavior is: copying a bitmask (for example: layers 1 and 3) allows the user to immediately paste 5 into an external text editor, while maintaining the existing internal copy-paste functionality within the Godot editor.\r\n\r\n### Manual tests\r\n- Tested `collision_layer` and `collision_mask` on Windows using the rebuilt editor.\r\n- Verified external clipboard values: layers 1+2 → `3`, no layers → `0`, layer 32 → `2147483648`.\r\n- Verified internal **Paste Value** applied the expected layers.\r\n- Verified **Copy Property Path** returned `collision_layer` and `collision_mask`.\r\n\r\nAI Disclosure: I used an AI to analyze the internal clipboard desync behavior and find the location of the issue.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-06T19:29:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T18:33:28Z","closed_at":"2026-10-07T18:33:07Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e65abaf2179da68d4ed0147fa3d4a647dc197350","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Flaybe:fix-inspector-integer-clipboard","ref":"fix-inspector-integer-clipboard","repo":{"id":1369624674,"node_id":"R_kgDOUaLQYg","name":"godot","full_name":"Flaybe/godot","owner":{"login":"Flaybe","id":8083756,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwODM3NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8083756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe","html_url":"https://github.com/Flaybe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flaybe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.